            This can be interpreted as forming, from a joint distribution, the pair of its marginals, which in general encode less information. The same can be done for joint distributions over a larger number of factors, including
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/infinite+tensor+product"} infinite products
          %p
