            In
            = succeed "," do
              %em Stoch
          %p
            More on this (and examples in other Markov categories) can be found at
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Markov+category#states_channels_joints_marginals"} Markov category - States, channels, joints, marginals
          %h2#see_also See also
